# A subtype name of 128 characters: RFC 6838 caps type and subtype names at 127.
@prefix pim: <http://www.w3.org/ns/pim/space#> . @prefix lws: <https://www.w3.org/ns/lws#> . @prefix did: <https://www.w3.org/ns/did#> . @prefix ssd: <https://jeswr.org/ns/solid-sd#> .
<https://pod.example/> a pim:Storage ; did:service [ a lws:StorageRoot ; did:serviceEndpoint <https://pod.example/> ] ; lws:capability [ a ssd:PatchSupport ; ssd:source "text/turtle" ; ssd:patchType "text/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa" ] .
